{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "2845c671-9de2-4e92-bad8-4d700d22f9f8",
    "name": "DF-11 - Responsable Temporal (boundary bug)",
    "description": "Reproduccion DF-11/DF-57: un responsable temporal debe poder iniciar una accion durante todo el dia hasta, inclusive. Configurar base_url del tenant, credenciales admin y temporal, temp_user_id y accion_id de una accion abierta asignada a un usuario distinto. La variable today usa America/Guatemala por defecto; se puede especificar YYYY-MM-DD para otro caso. Para datos desechables en Docker Compose: python postman/verify_responsable_temporal.py.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "10411939",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/10411939-2845c671-9de2-4e92-bad8-4d700d22f9f8?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login admin",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const data = pm.response.json();",
              "if (data.access) { pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', data.access); }",
              "pm.test('login admin OK', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login/",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "login",
            ""
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Asignar responsable temporal (hasta = hoy)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('asignacion OK', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"responsable_temporal_id\": {{temp_user_id}},\n  \"responsable_temporal_hasta\": \"{{today}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/acciones/{{accion_id}}/responsable-temporal/",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "acciones",
            "{{accion_id}}",
            "responsable-temporal",
            ""
          ]
        },
        "description": "Fecha inclusiva YYYY-MM-DD (today), sin hora."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Login responsable temporal",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const data = pm.response.json();",
              "if (data.access) { pm.collectionVariables.set('temp_token', data.access); }",
              "pm.test('login temporal OK', () => { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{temp_user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{temp_user_password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login/",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "login",
            ""
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Transicion a en_proceso (repro bug DF-11)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('DF-57: ultimo dia inclusivo', () => {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().estado).to.eql('en_proceso');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{temp_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"estado\": \"en_proceso\",\n  \"comentario\": \"Repro DF-11: intento el ultimo dia de la asignacion temporal\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/acciones/{{accion_id}}/transition/",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "acciones",
            "{{accion_id}}",
            "transition",
            ""
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 200 OK (el responsable temporal sigue vigente el dia 'hasta'). Con el bug: 403 Forbidden."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://demo.localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "temp_user_email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "temp_user_password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "temp_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accion_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "temp_user_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "today",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const configured = pm.collectionVariables.get('today');",
          "const parts = Object.fromEntries(new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', {",
          "  timeZone: 'America/Guatemala', year: 'numeric', month: '2-digit', day: '2-digit'",
          "}).formatToParts(new Date()).map(part => [part.type, part.value]));",
          "pm.variables.set('today', configured || `${parts.year}-${parts.month}-${parts.day}`);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
